{"id":233959110849899,"type":"artist","name":"Sadus","artist":null,"year":1984,"weight":10,"info":{"tags":["thrash metal","Technical Thrash Metal","death metal","metal","thrash"],"country":"US","begin":"1984","kind":"Group","similar":["Dark Angel","Morbid Saint","Demolition Hammer","Protector","Forbidden","Razor","Sacrifice","Coroner","Whiplash","Vio-Lence"],"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/92cf1b9bc4d7c3c21a739d3cba830448/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Sadus es una banda de Technical Thrash Metal procedente de Estados Unidos, California. La banda no empieza la carrera real hasta 1986 pero los primeros proyectos empezaron en el año 1984, han pasado por una gran evolucion, ya que su estilo propio se creó en el segundo disco, un Thrash Metal parecido a Slayer pero con sonido más demoledor y una voz más rapida y cruda. Su último CD: Out for Blood (2006) ha tenido un cambio de estilo bastante fuerte, ya que se parece al Technical Death Metal.\n\nSadus"},"works":[{"id":223756247120617,"type":"album","name":"Illusions","artist":"Sadus","year":1988,"weight":16,"yt":"_556UZovJno","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":52032266791182,"name":"Scaruffi 1980s","rank":698,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":60421153805592,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Bay Area Thrash Metal","rank":9,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":83793645545548,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Thrash Metal","rank":53,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":198714299897696,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Technical Thrash Metal","rank":11,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":4}},{"id":136544243734476,"type":"album","name":"Swallowed in Black","artist":"Sadus","year":1990,"weight":11,"yt":"RFxLGv2Phd8","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":90391435651867,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","rank":27,"scaruffi":null},{"id":60421153805592,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Bay Area Thrash Metal